<H2><FONT COLOR="#D60021">5.6.1.6.</FONT></H2>
</TD>
<TD VALIGN=top>
<H2>Validate the Fitted Model</H2>
</TD>
</TR >
</TABLE>
</TD>
</TR>







<!-- begin paragraph -->
<TR>
<TD WIDTH=15% VALIGN=top>
<!-- Add marginal notes below -->
<A NAME="partmodel">
<I>
Model Validation
</I>
</A>
</TD>
<TD WIDTH=85%>
<!-- Add main text below -->
The previous sections have led us to the model
<UL>
    <img src="splett3/eqns/partmode.gif">
</UL>
The residual standard deviation of this model is 0.30429.
<P>
The next step is to 
<a href="../../pmd/section4/pmd44.htm">validate the model</a>.
We do this through various residual plots.

</TD>
</TR>
<!-- end paragraph -->

<!-- begin paragraph -->
<TR>
<TD WIDTH=15% VALIGN=top>
<!-- Add marginal notes below -->
<A NAME="resplots">
<I>
Residual Plots
</I>
</A>
</TD>
<TD WIDTH=85% VALIGN=TOP>
<!-- Add main text below -->
<P>
<A HREF="splett3/gifs/part_f.gif">
<img src="splett3/gifs/part_r.gif"
     HEIGHT=425 WIDTH=550 BORDER=0
     alt="various residual plots do not indicate any serious problems with the model">
</A>
<P>
The first plot is a
<a href="../../eda/section3/normprpl.htm">normal probability plot</a>
of the residuals.  The second plot is a
<a href="../../eda/section3/runseqpl.htm">run sequence plot</a>
of the residuals.  The remaining plots are plots of the residuals
against each of the factors and each of the interaction terms.
<P>
These plots do not reveal any major problems that would lead us
to reject the model.

</TD>
</TR>
<!-- end paragraph -->




   
